## What I Learned

### Launching Requires More Than Deployment

Deployment is only one step. A successful release depends on thorough validation, documentation, and user experience.

### Production Confidence Comes From Testing

Multiple rounds of testing help eliminate hidden issues before users encounter them.

### Documentation Matters

A well-documented project improves usability, collaboration, and long-term maintenance.

